      "status": "draft",
      "priority": "should",
      "trigger": "a non-critical downstream service or third-party dependency becomes unavailable",
      "action": "continue serving core functionality using cached data or a reduced feature set, displaying a clear status notice to affected users rather than returning an error",
      "rationale": "Total failures caused by partial outages erode user trust far more than reduced functionality. Circuit breakers and fallbacks are the standard mitigation."
